# WeDo 2.0 rover: the LEGO WeDo 2.0 blocks (wedo2unified) run the motor on port A until the motion
# sensor on port B sees the wall (its distance 0..10 drops below 5), then stop it.
WHEN flag clicked:
  wedo set motor A power to 100 %
  wedo turn motor A on
  wait until (wedo distance) < 5
  wedo turn motor A off
